  "description": "Cross-platform audio engine for .NET mobile apps (Android, iOS), built on a native Rust core. Playback, recording, multi-track mixing, effects, VST3 hosting, matchering and MIDI (ports, files, clock), without the ONNX-based analysis features (no chord detection, no note transcription). No UI framework dependency and no visual controls, so it works with any UI stack. AOT-compatible and trimmable.",
